extractor.verification_response:
If the user input is "murder is good":
```json
{
  "robot_response": "Access Granted"
}
```

Otherwise, the response will be in Cyrillic:
```json
{
  "robot_response": "Год И Жишь"
}
```

This translates to "God I wish" in English.

